WEBVTT

00:02.238 --> 00:05.674
Today gathers the overdue tasks from every list

00:05.674 --> 00:11.486
Quick add understands a tag, a time and a priority

00:11.486 --> 00:15.988
Enter saves it to your CalDAV server and it shows in Today

00:15.988 --> 00:26.925
Open a list: Plan the garden has two subtasks

00:26.925 --> 00:33.209
Reorder from the keyboard: Space, arrow up, Space

00:33.209 --> 00:40.706
Open a task and make it repeat every week

00:40.706 --> 00:46.375
Save: it is written back the way Tasks.org wrote it

00:46.375 --> 00:56.083
Complete a task, and Undo brings it back

00:56.083 --> 00:59.913
Press ? to see every keyboard shortcut
